After a drought of ascensions lasting a few versions of nethack (last 
having been with version 3.0 IIRC), finally got there.

Started with + of identify, which makes life easier. Mostly nothing too 
amazing happened. Got some magic markers, including some from bones, main 
use was to make ? of genocide. Prayed a lot at alters to improve hp. More 
wands of wishing than usual, 3 in total. 1 spoily wish for Master Key of 
Thievery.

Ran into real trouble on the plane of air. Monsters summoning other 
monsters reached critical mass. Helped by conflict and archons, titans, 
ki-rin becoming extinct. Left a whole bunch of them alive on the level 
since they were over at the other side, ignoring me.

Get to plane of fire, and have to get rid of the large number that got 
there before me.

Water was easy.

Astral plane, no problem, except, as usual, the correct altar is in the 
last place I look.


